  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "brief",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 420,
      "text": "Factory Foreman — redesign v1\n\nDirection A (this page): industrial editorial. Warm paper, graphite ink, one signal orange, Schibsted Grotesk + JetBrains Mono. Deliberately nothing from TrueForge: no dark rail, no indigo, no glass.\n\nRow 2: auth is new — TrueForge only had an OIDC redirect. Sign in / create workspace / onboarding are designed from scratch.\nRows 3–5: every app surface, with real data from today's dogfood run.\n\nPage 'Directions' holds two low-fi alternates (B dark control room, C Swiss) if A is not it.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "naming",
      "x": 1980,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 360,
      "text": "Name\n\nUsed here: product 'Foreman', full name 'Factory Foreman', workspace URL foreman.app/<slug>.\n\nAlternates if you want a fresher name: 'Shopfloor' (the place work happens), 'Gantry' (what moves work along the line). Text is editable in place; the mark works with any of them.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "auth-note",
      "x": 4560,
      "y": 1140,
      "w": 300,
      "text": "Auth model assumed: GitHub OAuth as the primary sign-in (the same org that owns the App), magic-link email as the fallback, optional enterprise IdP. No passwords.",
      "page": "page-1"
    }
  ],
